flowchart TB
    M[IFX modular monolith release]
    MIG[One-shot IFX.DatabaseMigrator]
    API[ApiHost runtime - no DDL]

    M --> MIG
    M --> API
    MIG -->|migration identity| PDB
    API -->|runtime identity| PDB

    subgraph PDB[SQL Server / shared physical IFXDb]
        A[auth\nIfxDbContext\nauth.__EFMigrationsHistory\nOutbox/Inbox owned by Auth]
        C[crm\nCrmDbContext\ncrm.__EFMigrationsHistory\nOutbox/Inbox owned by CRM]
        R[registry\nRegistryDbContext\nregistry.__EFMigrationsHistory\nOutbox/Inbox owned by Registry]
        H[holdings\nHoldingsDbContext\nholdings.__EFMigrationsHistory\nOutbox/Inbox owned by Holdings]
        T[transaction\nTransactionDbContext\ntransaction.__EFMigrationsHistory\nOutbox/Inbox owned by Transaction]
    end

    A -. no cross-schema FK, join, trigger, procedure or write .- C
    C -. communicate through Contracts or Events .- R
    R -. future split uses its existing connection key .- H
    H -. ownership remains module-local .- T
